sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Visitor
  participant JS as chatbot.js
  participant WP as WordPress
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant LF as Langfuse
  U->>JS: thumbs up / down
  JS->>WP: POST /feedback<br/>{trace_id, value} + nonce
  WP->>WP: nonce, 60/hour per IP,<br/>trace_id = 32 hex
  WP->>API: POST /feedback<br/>+ X-API-Key
  API->>LF: score "user-feedback"<br/>(BOOLEAN) on the trace
  API-->>WP: 204
  WP-->>JS: ok
  JS-->>U: "Thanks for the feedback!"
